        <mxCell id="8exCCuX_iSED-QHY19kr-201" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Veristand project is deployed succesfully&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Internally verifies functionality&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Test Bench related IO initialization, not product related&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;SLSC DIO configuration&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;FPGA deploy&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;RMX communication is&amp;nbsp; started&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Verify that Veristand alarms are not activated&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Temperatures, Voltage levels are in limits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Alarms needs to be specified later and implemented in Veristand&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Verify connected product box adapter&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Future option&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Read resistance of resistor to identify connected box&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;verticalAlign=middle;overflow=hidden;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="8exCCuX_iSED-QHY19kr-195">
